{"unit_id":"tag:024Z:statement","translation":"固定数域（fields）的一个扩张（extension）<MATH_0001>，其整数（integers）环（rings）为<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>。单射（injection）<MATH_0004>定义了一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>。\n如上所述，使<MATH_0006>在我们的意义下非分歧（unramified）的点（points），对应于使<MATH_0007>在通常意义下非分歧（unramified）的点（points）所成的集合（set）。在通常意义下，<MATH_0008>中的分歧（ramification）轨迹（locus）可以用不同式（different）的消失集（set）来定义；这是<MATH_0009>中的一个理想（ideal）。实际上，不同式（different）正是模（module）<MATH_0010>的零化子（annihilator）。类似地，判别式（discriminant）是<MATH_0011>中的一个理想（ideal），即不同式（different）的范数（norm）。判别式（discriminant）的消失集（set）恰为<MATH_0012>中在<MATH_0013>里发生分歧（ramify）的点（points）所成的集合（set）。\n因此，用<MATH_0014>表示不同式（different）在<MATH_0015>中定义的闭子集（closed subset）的补集（complement），我们得到一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0016>，它是非分歧（unramified）的。\n此外，这个态射（morphism）也是平坦（flat）的，因为离散赋值环（discrete valuation rings）之间的任意局部同态（local homomorphism）都是平坦（flat）的，因此这个态射（morphism）实际上是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的。如果<MATH_0017>是有限（finite）伽罗瓦（Galois）的，则用<MATH_0018>表示判别式（discriminant）在<MATH_0019>中定义的闭子集（closed subset）的补集（complement），我们看到甚至得到有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0020>。因此，这是有限（finite）平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（covering）的一个例子。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"数域"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张"},{"source_term":"integers","target_term":"整数"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"ramification","target_term":"分歧"},{"source_term":"locus","target_term":"轨迹"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"消失集"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"annihilator","target_term":"零化子"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"norm","target_term":"范数"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"消失集"},{"source_term":"ramify","target_term":"发生分歧"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"discrete valuation rings","target_term":"离散赋值环"},{"source_term":"local homomorphism","target_term":"局部同态"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"Galois","target_term":"伽罗瓦"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"fields","target_term":"数域","context":"number fields中的域，数的限定在中文中保留；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"extension","target_term":"扩张","context":"固定的数域扩张，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"integers","target_term":"整数","context":"数域的整数环，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环","context":"数域整数环，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"injection","target_term":"单射","context":"原文的域嵌入，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"各处谱间映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"本章意义及通常意义的非分歧性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"源文各处的点，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"满足相应条件的点的集合，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"ramification","target_term":"分歧","context":"通常意义的分歧轨迹，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"locus","target_term":"轨迹","context":"分歧发生的位置，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"different","target_term":"不同式","context":"原文明言为整数环中理想的different，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"消失集","context":"vanishing set中的集合，消失的限定在中文中保留；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"ideal","target_term":"理想","context":"不同式及判别式所在的理想，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"微分模，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"annihilator","target_term":"零化子","context":"微分模的零化子，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"discriminant","target_term":"判别式","context":"数域扩张的判别式理想，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"norm","target_term":"范数","context":"不同式的范数，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"ramify","target_term":"发生分歧","context":"原文关于点的分歧动词，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集","context":"不同式与判别式定义的闭子集，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"complement","target_term":"补集","context":"两处闭子集的补集，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"态射及局部同态的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"discrete valuation rings","target_term":"离散赋值环","context":"局部平坦性论述中的环，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"local homomorphism","target_term":"局部同态","context":"离散赋值环之间的同态，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"étale","target_term":"平展","context":"所得态射及覆盖的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"伽罗瓦性质及后两处平展性的限定，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Galois","target_term":"伽罗瓦","context":"数域扩张的伽罗瓦性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"末句的有限平展覆盖，暂译待决。"}],"notes":["remark: 原文由K到L的单射称定义整数环谱间态射，并写K的点在L中分歧；相关数学占位符均原样保留，未补改为其他谱或环映射。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0254:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n研究平坦（flat）态射（morphisms）的一个重要原因是，它们为刻画概形（schemes）的族（family）提供了适当框架，其中参数化（parametrized）由另一个概形（scheme）的点（points）给出。直观地，人们可能认为，任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0001>都应视为一个族（family），其参数化（parametrized）由<MATH_0002>的点（points）给出。然而，若不对<MATH_0003>施加平坦性（flatness）限制，这个所谓的族（family）中就可能发生十分奇异的现象。例如，我们并不能保证相对维数（relative dimension）（即纤维（fibres）的维数（dimension））在一个族（family）中恒定（constant）。其他数值不变量（numerical invariants），例如希尔伯特多项式（Hilbert polynomial），也可能从一个纤维（fibre）到另一个纤维（fibre）而变化。平坦性（Flatness）阻止这类现象发生，从而为纤维（fibres）提供了某种“连续性（continuity）”。\n\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"parametrized","target_term":"参数化"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"parametrized","target_term":"参数化"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"relative dimension","target_term":"相对维数"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"恒定"},{"source_term":"numerical invariants","target_term":"数值不变量"},{"source_term":"Hilbert polynomial","target_term":"希尔伯特多项式"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"continuity","target_term":"连续性"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"研究对象的平坦性，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"本段开头的映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"族中的几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"family","target_term":"族","context":"本段四处讨论的参数化对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"parametrized","target_term":"参数化","context":"由底概形的点给出参数，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"给出参数的另一个几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"points","target_term":"点","context":"两处给出参数的点，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"任意所给映射，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"施加于态射的限制，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"relative dimension","target_term":"相对维数","context":"族的维数性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fibres","target_term":"纤维","context":"相对维数定义及最后一句的几何对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数","context":"括号解释中的纤维维数，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"constant","target_term":"恒定","context":"相对维数在族中不变的性质，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"numerical invariants","target_term":"数值不变量","context":"除相对维数之外的量，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Hilbert polynomial","target_term":"希尔伯特多项式","context":"所举数值不变量，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"逐个比较数值不变量的对象，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"Flatness","target_term":"平坦性","context":"最后一句的性质名称，暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"continuity","target_term":"连续性","context":"原文带引号的直观性质，暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
